      "text" : "{\"schemaVersion\":\"1.8\",\"facts\":[{\"factId\":\"f1\",\"support\":{\"statementIds\":[\"s3013ca528b16v1u0011\",\"s3013ca528b16v1u0013\",\"s3013ca528b16v1u0016\",\"s3013ca528b16v1u0020\",\"s3013ca528b16v1u0022\",\"s3013ca528b16v1u0023\",\"s3013ca528b16v1u0044\"],\"questionIds\":[],\"answerIds\":[],\"correctionIds\":[]},\"kind\":\"SYMPTOM\",\"text\":\"어제 시작한 왼쪽 뒤쪽의 두통이 있고, 처음에는 꽤 세게 욱신거렸으며 점점 심해졌고 통증은 8/10이다.\",\"condition\":{\"operator\":\"NONE\",\"clauses\":[]},\"medicationRole\":\"NONE\",\"alternativeGroup\":null,\"actionStatus\":\"NONE\",\"medication\":null,\"task\":null,\"uncertaintyCodes\":[]},{\"factId\":\"f2\",\"support\":{\"statementIds\":[\"s3013ca528b16v1u0025\",\"s3013ca528b16v1u0029\",\"s3013ca528b16v1u0032\",\"s3013ca528b16v1u0036\",\"s3013ca528b16v1u0038\",\"s3013ca528b16v1u0040\",\"s3013ca528b16v1u0042\",\"s3013ca528b16v1u0052\",\"s3013ca528b16v1u0054\",\"s3013ca528b16v1u0056\",\"s3013ca528b16v1u0058\",\"s3013ca528b16v1u0062\",\"s3013ca528b16v1u0074\",\"s3013ca528b16v1u0082\"],\"questionIds\":[],\"answerIds\":[],\"correctionIds\":[]},\"kind\":\"SYMPTOM\",\"text\":\"두통과 함께 메스꺼움, 구토, 따끔거림, 감각 둔함, 힘 빠짐, 흐린 시야, 눈 주변 통증, 이상한 빛이 보이거나 빛을 볼 때의 문제, 고열, 오한, 땀, 발진은 없다.\",\"condition\":{\"operator\":\"NONE\",\"clauses\":[]},\"medicationRole\":\"NONE\",\"alternativeGroup\":null,\"actionStatus\":\"NONE\",\"medication\":null,\"task\":null,\"uncertaintyCodes\":[]},{\"factId\":\"f3\",\"support\":{\"statementIds\":[\"s3013ca528b16v1u0034\",\"s3013ca528b16v1u0050\"],\"questionIds\":[],\"answerIds\":[],\"correctionIds\":[]},\"kind\":\"SYMPTOM\",\"text\":\"식사와 물은 평소대로 섭취하고 있고, 어젯밤은 잘 잤다.\",\"condition\":{\"operator\":\"NONE\",\"clauses\":[]},\"medicationRole\":\"NONE\",\"alternativeGroup\":null,\"actionStatus\":\"NONE\",\"medication\":null,\"task\":null,\"uncertaintyCodes\":[]},{\"factId\":\"f4\",\"support\":{\"statementIds\":[\"s3013ca528b16v1u0046\",\"s3013ca528b16v1u0048\",\"s3013ca528b16v1u0060\"],\"questionIds\":[],\"answerIds\":[],\"correctionIds\":[]},\"kind\":\"MEDICATION\",\"text\":\"어제 Nurofen(Ibuprofen)을 복용했으나 효과는 별로 없었다.\",\"condition\":{\"operator\":\"NONE\",\"clauses\":[]},\"medicationRole\":\"HISTORICAL\",\"alternativeGroup\":null,\"actionStatus\":\"NONE\",\"medication\":{\"name\":\"Nurofen / Ibuprofen\",\"doseText\":null,\"frequencyText\":null,\"courseDurationText\":\"어제\",\"instructions\":\"복용했으나 효과는 별로 없었다.\",\"startsOn\":null,\"endsOn\":null,\"clockTimes\":[],\"scheduleRecurrence\":null,\"weekdays\":[]},\"task\":null,\"uncertaintyCodes\":[]},{\"factId\":\"f5\",\"support\":{\"statementIds\":[\"s3013ca528b16v1u0056\",\"s3013ca528b16v1u0058\",\"s3013ca528b16v1u0062\",\"s3013ca528b16v1u0076\",\"s3013ca528b16v1u0078\",\"s3013ca528b16v1u0080\"],\"questionIds\":[],\"answerIds\":[],\"correctionIds\":[]},\"kind\":\"ASSESSMENT\",\"text\":\"다른 질환, 약을 먹는 질환, 위 문제, 천식, 흡연, 정기적인 음주, 다른 약물 사용은 없다.\",\"condition\":{\"operator\":\"NONE\",\"clauses\":[]},\"medicationRole\":\"NONE\",\"alternativeGroup\":null,\"actionStatus\":\"NONE\",\"medication\":null,\"task\":null,\"uncertaintyCodes\":[]},{\"factId\":\"f6\",\"support\":{\"statementIds\":[\"s3013ca528b16v1u0064\"],\"questionIds\":[],\"answerIds\":[],\"correctionIds\":[]},\"kind\":\"ASSESSMENT\",\"text\":\"어머니는 고혈압과 편두통이 있다.\",\"condition\":{\"operator\":\"NONE\",\"clauses\":[]},\"medicationRole\":\"NONE\",\"alternativeGroup\":null,\"actionStatus\":\"NONE\",\"medication\":null,\"task\":null,\"uncertaintyCodes\":[]},{\"factId\":\"f7\",\"support\":{\"statementIds\":[\"s3013ca528b16v1u0070\",\"s3013ca528b16v1u0072\"],\"questionIds\":[],\"answerIds\":[],\"correctionIds\":[]},\"kind\":\"ASSESSMENT\",\"text\":\"파트너와 함께 살고 있으며 직업은 디자이너다.\",\"condition\":{\"operator\":\"NONE\",\"clauses\":[]},\"medicationRole\":\"NONE\",\"alternativeGroup\":null,\"actionStatus\":\"NONE\",\"medication\":null,\"task\":null,\"uncertaintyCodes\":[]},{\"factId\":\"f8\",\"support\":{\"statementIds\":[\"s3013ca528b16v1u0074\"],\"questionIds\":[],\"answerIds\":[],\"correctionIds\":[]},\"kind\":\"SYMPTOM\",\"text\":\"일이나 평소 하던 일을 하기 어렵다.\",\"condition\":{\"operator\":\"NONE\",\"clauses\":[]},\"medicationRole\":\"NONE\",\"alternativeGroup\":null,\"actionStatus\":\"NONE\",\"medication\":null,\"task\":null,\"uncertaintyCodes\":[]},{\"factId\":\"f9\",\"support\":{\"statementIds\":[\"s3013ca528b16v1u0083\",\"s3013ca528b16v1u0084\",\"s3013ca528b16v1u0086\"],\"questionIds\":[],\"answerIds\":[],\"correctionIds\":[]},\"kind\":\"MEDICATION\",\"text\":\"Ibuprofen 대신 더 강한 진통제를 쓰고, 함께는 먹지 말며, 규칙적으로 음식과 함께 복용한다. Paracetamol은 함께 복용할 수 있다.\",\"condition\":{\"operator\":\"NONE\",\"clauses\":[]},\"medicationRole\":\"PRESCRIBED\",\"alternativeGroup\":null,\"actionStatus\":\"NONE\",\"medication\":{\"name\":null,\"doseText\":null,\"frequencyText\":\"규칙적으로\",\"courseDurationText\":null,\"instructions\":\"Ibuprofen 대신, 같이 먹지는 말고, 음식과 함께 복용. Paracetamol은 함께 복용 가능.\",\"startsOn\":null,\"endsOn\":null,\"clockTimes\":[],\"scheduleRecurrence\":null,\"weekdays\":[]},\"task\":null,\"uncertaintyCodes\":[]},{\"factId\":\"f10\",\"support\":{\"statementIds\":[\"s3013ca528b16v1u0088\",\"s3013ca528b16v1u0089\",\"s3013ca528b16v1u0094\",\"s3013ca528b16v1u0095\"],\"questionIds\":[],\"answerIds\":[],\"correctionIds\":[]},\"kind\":\"FOLLOW_UP\",\"text\":\"통증이 심해지거나 열, 발진, 구토, 목이 뻣뻣함 같은 새 증상이 생기거나 같은 증상이 반복되면 다시 상담해서 다음 계획을 정하고, 약국에서 처방약을 받아 써 본 뒤 다시 전화한다.\",\"condition\":{\"operator\":\"COMPLEX\",\"clauses\":[\"통증이 심해지거나 열, 발진, 구토, 목이 뻣뻣함 같은 새 증상이 생기면 다시 상담한다.\",\"같은 증상이 반복되면 다시 상담한다.\",\"약국에서 처방약을 받아 써 본 뒤 다시 전화한다.\"]},\"medicationRole\":\"NONE\",\"alternativeGroup\":null,\"actionStatus\":\"FUTURE\",\"medication\":null,\"task\":{\"kind\":\"OTHER\",\"title\":\"다시 상담/전화\",\"date\":null,\"time\":null,\"recurrence\":\"ONCE\",\"lastDate\":null,\"weekdays\":[]},\"uncertaintyCodes\":[]}],\"summaryFactIds\":[\"f1\",\"f9\",\"f10\"]}"
